# Evidence Screenshots

This directory contains visual evidence captured during the Linux SSH authentication log analysis.

## Planned Evidence

| Screenshot | Description |
|---|---|
| 01-log-volume.png | Total number of log records analyzed |
| 02-failed-authentication.png | Failed SSH password authentication count |
| 03-top-targeted-usernames.png | Most frequently targeted usernames |
| 04-top-source-ips.png | Source IPs generating failed authentication records |
| 05-successful-logins.png | Source IPs associated with successful password authentication |
| 06-ip-correlation.png | IP addresses appearing in both failed and successful authentication records |

## Evidence Collection

Screenshots are captured directly from Windows PowerShell to preserve the original command output.

All evidence is intended to support the findings documented in `Analysis/findings.csv`.

